  "description": "MIT-licensed English grapheme-to-phoneme (text to phoneme) for .NET, with no dependencies and no native binaries. A permissive replacement for GPL-3 espeak-ng as a text-to-speech frontend: CMUdict pronunciation lookup, morphological decomposition for unknown words, and letter-to-sound rules LEARNED from CMUdict and measured on held-out words. Outputs ARPAbet or IPA with stress. Runs in Blazor WebAssembly - the dictionary and rules are embedded in the assembly.",
  "id": "SpawnDev.Phonemizer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
